homelab-notes (0.3.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Every dialog (share, move, history, download, the prompts) was drawn
    UNDER the theme's backdrop and read as grey on black, and the page
    behind it was dimmed twice: the dialog sat at the backdrop's own level
    instead of the theme's --z-modal, and the page opened its own backdrop
    beside the shell's. Dialogs now sit above the backdrop, and only the
    shell's backdrop is used (post-cutover #102).

